        "eafaf0d3-e5ea-469d-9576-e4ec04f9f907": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 288,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThis flow works on the Notion database **Docs** (`6a479175-a340-4bff-b278-93df6acb2613`) of the test workspace, set as *Database ID* on the components.\n\nOn a fresh workspace: share a database with the integration that has a `Title` (title) and an `Email` (email) property, and put its ID into every Notion component of this flow.\n\n**Do not remove the Wait.** The trigger only takes a baseline on its first poll and emits items that are created later; an item created at flow start lands in the baseline and is never emitted.\n\nThe cleanup archives the item the trigger emitted."
        }
    }
